==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*7 [[Red Slug]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
The only enemy you really need to worry about is [[Lord Enma]]. Bring units that outrange them like [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]] to slowly but surely chip damage off of Enma or Rushers like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] and [[Crazed Giraffe Cat]] in order to prevent Enma from taking more ground while chipping him off at the same time

